{
  "bookId": "hero-211002",
  "id": "bond-27505",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27505001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我可以帮忙。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27505002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "时光无法倒流，逝去的人无法复生——\n如同这块怀表的主人，再也不会回来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27505003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我一直在给FULI公司写信，建议将下士芙蕾——\n以及其他一些角色手办化。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27505004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "......什么？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27505005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "在新的世界重生，对你们而言意味着另一种可能：一个实现完美结局的可能。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27505006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "为我......做到了这种地步吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27505007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "也是希望给她们一个更好的归宿。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27505008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "我会和你一起，一直等那一天的到来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27505009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "从现在开始......如果你愿意，任何时候都可以，来我身后。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
